Z||000007||Nashco||12-05-2001||01:51 PM||||I just bought the tube that DXR is now producing.  Yay, I get to say I was the first person in on this run of what I think is an awesome product!  It is polished aluminum.  If you requested it, I'm sure you could get an unfinished one so you can powdercoat it to match your car <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>The bends are very nice, and it comes with all the hook up holes needed.  I'm very pleased with it, and will be buying my filter for it soon hopefully.<P>Summit part # TCN-SF007RD..........$39.95<P>That's the part number, the RD signifies Red.  It is available in black, blue, yellow, red, chrome, and carbon fiber I believe, all the same cost.<P>If you're getting this, don't order the filter yet, I have to make sure I get one first <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Oh, by the way, the filter is not in their catalog OR their website, but they state they have plenty in stock.  I don't know why they don't have many others, but let's keep this under our hats...can't let the other car guys swallow them up!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
